          </item>
          <item>
           <widget class="QLabel" name="about_import_label">
            <property name="text">
             <string>The PSG signal file gives the start time of the recording: when the EDF+ file starts at another time, Snooz moves the annotations to align them with the PSG signal file. The imported annotations are added to the accessory file; the annotations already there with the same group and name are removed first. Sleep stages get the group stage, the other annotations the group EDF annotations, with their text as name.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Each EDF+ file goes with one PSG file. To import the annotations of several EDF+ files into the same PSG file, run the tool once per EDF+ file.</string>
            </property>
            <property name="textFormat">
             <enum>Qt::TextFormat::RichText</enum>
            </property>
            <property name="wordWrap">
             <bool>true</bool>
            </property>
            <property name="variant" stdset="0">
             <string notr="true">help</string>
